{#
/**
 * @file views-view--couples-grid--page-1.html.twig
 *
 * Couples listing page — full 3-section layout.
 * React reference: CouplesPage.tsx (react-template/src/pages/)
 * composition.md §5: No invitation band on listing pages.
 *
 * Sections:
 *   1. Minimal listing header  (bg-base-100) — h1 + lede
 *   2. Brief editorial framing (bg-base-200) — framingNote prose
 *   3. Couples card grid       (bg-base-100) — {{ rows }} (grid wrapper in
 *      views-view-unformatted--couples-grid.html.twig)
 *
 * Motion: none above the fold. Card hover (transition-colors duration-150) is
 * the only motion on the page — handled by node--couple--teaser.html.twig and
 * the global prefers-reduced-motion override in a11y.pcss.
 *
 * Strings: use Twig |t filter so they register in Drupal's translation UI.
 */
#}

{# Section 1 — Minimal listing header (base-100) #}
<section class="bg-base-100">
  <div class="reading-column pt-14 pb-8">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">
      {{ 'Couples'|t }}
    </h1>
    {# D2: full ink (not opacity-80) — 14.43:1 contrast on base-100. #}
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg">{{ 'A place built around Drupal couples, starting with the founders.'|t }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# Section 2 — Brief editorial framing (base-200, one tonal ground step) #}
<section class="bg-base-200">
  <div class="reading-column reading-prose py-10">
    {# D2: full ink (not opacity-90) — 11.87:1 on base-200. #}
    <p class="max-w-[66ch]">{{ 'We built this around couples because two voices tell a more honest story than one. This is the directory, and it starts with ours. Who else belongs here?'|t }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# Section 3 — Couples card grid (base-100)
   D1: aria-labelledby + h2 closes the H1→H3 skip (was H1 in S1, H3 inside each card). #}
<section class="bg-base-100 py-12" aria-labelledby="couples-grid-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4">
    <h2 id="couples-grid-heading" class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold mb-6">
      {{ 'Browse couples'|t }}
    </h2>

    {% if rows %}
      {# Grid wrapper rendered by views-view-unformatted--couples-grid.html.twig #}
      {{ rows }}
    {% elseif empty %}
      <p class="text-muted">{{ empty }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
